Key Market Drivers
1. Rising Demand for High-Speed Data Centers
The Co-Packaged Optics (CPO) Switch Market is experiencing significant growth due to increasing demand for high-performance data centers. With cloud computing and AI workloads requiring faster data transmission, CPO switches offer lower latency and improved power efficiency compared to traditional solutions. Data centers handling over 400G and 800G applications are actively adopting CPO technology.

2. Power Efficiency Advantages
CPO switches reduce power consumption by up to 30% in hyperscale data center environments. This energy efficiency is becoming critical as operators face rising electricity costs and sustainability pressures. The technology's integrated approach eliminates the need for separate optical modules, significantly cutting power requirements.

